              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atatha kuchita pangano pa Beeriseba, Abimeleki ndi Fikolo mkulu wankhondo wake anabwerera ku dziko la Afilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
